<title>GERMANY: Reuters' 2nd ex-Frankfurt Asia/Mideast market repo.</title>
<headline>Reuters' 2nd ex-Frankfurt Asia/Mideast market repo.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-Frankfurt(FRA) German mark air cargo rates per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume to weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		   May 6     Mar 5</p>
<p>		    ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p>    FRA-BKK    2.75	2.80</p>
<p>    FRA-HKG    2.90	2.95</p>
<p>    FRA-KUL    2.85	2.85</p>
<p>    FRA-NRT    4.60	4.60</p>
<p>    FRA-SEL    3.85	3.90</p>
<p>    FRA-SHA    3.40	3.30</p>
<p>    FRA-SIN    2.85	2.85</p>
<p>    FRA-TPE    2.60	2.60</p>
<p>		  INDIAN SUB-CONTINENT</p>
<p>    FRA-BOM    1.85	1.85</p>
<p>		  MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p>    FRA-DXB    1.55	1.55</p>
<p>* The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuter journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at or near Frankfurt Airport.</p>
<p>* All prices are quoted in German marks.</p>
<p>* The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices, including standard, discount and spot rates, and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>--Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel +44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
